WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[soft electronic music; typing and an error sound]

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
[music builds, then pauses]

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
[music starts; locks click]

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:28.000
[mouse clicks, typing, switches and a confirmation sound]

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
[a click and denial sound; an app closes and an error sounds]

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
[electronic music builds; a limit and switch sound]

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.000
[music ends with a sustained chord]
